phrase: cycle elements while below comparison limit {limit}
slot: limit int
test: list=2,5,10,12 limit=8
expect: => i=2 r=0.0 ok=true s="performed rotations 2" errors=0 n=4 res=[10,12,2,5] cache=0 hits=0
