phrase: evaluate middle while cache size under {limit}
slot: limit int
test: list=10,20,30,40,50 limit=4
expect: => i=4 r=0.0 ok=true s="cache capacity measured: 4" errors=0 n=5 res=[10,20,30,40,50] cache=4 hits=0
